OL,3,GNEWSATruckers take youngsters to
OL,4,Aseaside for 39th event
OL,5,
OL,6,FEighty-eight children were treated to a
OL,7,Fspecial day riding in convoy in the
OL,8,Fcarriages of trucks and lorries to the
OL,9,Fseaside.
OL,11,FMembers of the children's charity, East
OL,12,FCoast Truckers, returned for their 39th
OL,13,Fannual event for young people who are
OL,14,Fdisadvantaged or have disabilities.
OL,16,FThey left Norwich on Sunday for an
OL,17,Fafternoon at Pleasurewood Hills theme
OL,18,Fpark in Lowestoft, across the county
OL,19,Fborder in Suffolk.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
