OL,3,GNEWSATruckers take youngsters to
OL,4,Aseaside for 39th event
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganiser Trevor Howlett said the
OL,7,Fcrowds lining the streets made it feel
OL,8,F"really special for the children,
OL,9,Fmaking them and the drivers feel like
OL,10,Fcelebrities".
